  "(the rig's s1switches.json numbering), coils 1000 + node*64 + index.",
  "The switches are the triggers by place and the script's meaning on the rig's curated map (GUESS where a game on",
  "the table should confirm); the lights are the author's own with no numbering of the game's, so the lamps are",
